{"name":"Psychic","hex":"#625981","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"psychic","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A person who possesses, or appears to possess, extrasensory abilities such as clairvoyance, precognition and telepathy, as well as potentially interact externally using their minds or souls through telekinesis or teleportation, or who appears to be susceptible to paranormal or supernatural influences.","A person who supposedly contacts the dead; a medium."]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Relating to or having the abilities of a psychic.","Relating to the psyche or mind, or to mental activity in general."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/psychic"}],"entries":[{"title":"Psychic","blocks":[{"text":"A psychic is a person who claims to use powers rooted in parapsychology, such as extrasensory perception (ESP), to identify information hidden from the normal senses, particularly involving telepathy or clairvoyance; or who performs acts that are apparently inexplicable by natural laws, such as psychokinesis or teleportation. Although many people believe in psychic abilities, the scientific consensus is that there is no proof of the existence of such powers, and describes the practice as pseudoscience."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/2/23/PsychicBoston.jpg/330px-PsychicBoston.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Psychic"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Cayce_1910.jpg/500px-Cayce_1910.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/8/8d/Cayce_1910.jpg/500px-Cayce_1910.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Edgar Cayce (1877–1945) was a psychic of the 20th century and made many highly publicized predictions.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACayce_1910.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Psychic_Love_Specialist.jpg/500px-Psychic_Love_Specialist.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Psychic_Love_Specialist.jpg/1280px-Psychic_Love_Specialist.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a5/Psychic_Love_Specialist.jpg/500px-Psychic_Love_Specialist.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"\"Psychic Love Specialist\" in San Francisco. The business advertises palm and crystal readings, and tarot cards.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APsychic_Love_Specialist.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a9/Ganzfeld.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/a9/Ganzfeld.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"Participant of a Ganzfeld Experiment whose results have been criticized as being misinterpreted as evidence for telepathy","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AGanzfeld.jpg"}],"sounds":{"psychic":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/22/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-psychic.wav?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/22/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-psychic.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-psychic.wav.mp3"},{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/22/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-psychic.wav/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Vealhurl-psychic.wav.ogg"},{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9d/LL-Q18